# EAS Build uploads the project archive using this file instead of every
# .gitignore in the repo (root .gitignore AND mobile/.gitignore) — but ONLY
# when placed at the git repository root. It was previously at
# mobile/.easignore, which EAS Build never actually read (confirmed against
# Expo's own docs: ".easignore ... can only be located in the root of your
# git repository"), so EAS silently fell back to respecting mobile/.gitignore
# this whole time — which is exactly why ios/UstadApp/GoogleService-Info.plist
# kept vanishing from the archive even though the CI workflow wrote it to disk
# right before the build ran ("Build input file cannot be found" in Xcode).
#
# This file merges both .gitignore files' rules, rewritten relative to the
# repo root (mobile/.gitignore's patterns get a mobile/ or mobile/**/ prefix
# depending on whether they were already anchored), with ONE deliberate
# omission: the two Firebase config files below are intentionally NOT listed
# as ignored here, so EAS Build picks them up from local disk when CI writes
# them from secrets, the same way it already works for the iOS signing
# credentials (credentials.json / *.p12 / *.mobileprovision), which are
# handled through eas-cli's separate credentials upload path and were never
# affected by this bug.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored (must reach the EAS build machine):
#   android/app/google-services.json
#   mobile/ios/GoogleService-Info.plist
#   mobile/ios/UstadApp/GoogleService-Info.plist

# --- from the repo-root .gitignore (already root-relative, copied as-is) ---
node_modules/
mobile/node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*
mobile/android/.gradle/
mobile/android/build/
mobile/android/app/build/
mobile/android/app/.cxx/
mobile/ios/build/
mobile/ios/Pods/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.DS_Store
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- from mobile/.gitignore, rewritten relative to the repo root ---
mobile/**/.DS_Store
mobile/**/build/
mobile/**/*.pbxuser
!mobile/**/default.pbxuser
mobile/**/*.mode1v3
!mobile/**/default.mode1v3
mobile/**/*.mode2v3
!mobile/**/default.mode2v3
mobile/**/*.perspectivev3
!mobile/**/default.perspectivev3
mobile/**/xcuserdata
mobile/**/*.xccheckout
mobile/**/*.moved-aside
mobile/**/DerivedData
mobile/**/*.hmap
mobile/**/*.ipa
mobile/**/*.xcuserstate
mobile/**/.xcode.env.local
mobile/**/.idea
mobile/**/.gradle
mobile/**/local.properties
mobile/**/*.iml
mobile/**/*.hprof
mobile/**/.cxx/
mobile/**/*.keystore
!mobile/**/debug.keystore
mobile/**/.kotlin/
mobile/**/npm-debug.log
mobile/**/yarn-error.log
mobile/**/fastlane/report.xml
mobile/**/fastlane/Preview.html
mobile/**/fastlane/screenshots
mobile/**/fastlane/test_output
mobile/android/keystore.properties
mobile/android/RELEASE_SIGNING_SECRETS.env
mobile/**/.env
mobile/**/.env.*
!mobile/**/.env.example
mobile/**/credentials.json
mobile/**/*.jsbundle
mobile/**/*.bundle
mobile/**/Pods/
/mobile/vendor/bundle/
mobile/**/.metro-health-check*
/mobile/coverage
mobile/.yarn/*
!mobile/.yarn/patches
!mobile/.yarn/plugins
!mobile/.yarn/releases
!mobile/.yarn/sdks
!mobile/.yarn/versions
